{"sha": "8b3b862f82a0799faacdd8c91d50bb433c0014880b373da43f97b34b28360450", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:fourier:7}", "对 $f$ 与 $f'$ 分别使用帕塞瓦尔恒等式（两者均适用：$f$ 为 $C^1$，$f'$", "分段连续 --- 事实上连续）：", "\\[", "\\frac{1}{2\\pi}\\int \\abs f^2 = \\sum_{n\\neq0} \\abs{c_n}^2", "\\quad (c_0 = 0 \\text{ 由零均值假设}),", "\\qquad", "\\frac{1}{2\\pi}\\int \\abs{f'}^2 = \\sum_{n\\neq0} n^2\\abs{c_n}^2 .", "\\]", "逐项比较，$n^2\\abs{c_n}^2 \\geq \\abs{c_n}^2$ 对 $\\abs n \\geq 1$ 成立：", "由此得出不等式。等号成立时必有 $(n^2 - 1)\\abs{c_n}^2 = 0$", "对所有 $n$，即 $c_n = 0$（$\\abs n \\geq 2$）：$f(t) =", "c_1\\eu^{\\iu t} + c_{-1}\\eu^{-\\iu t} = a\\cos t + b\\sin t$（实", "形式）；反之，满足此形式的 $f$ 使等号成立。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:fourier:8}", "由 \\cref{exo:b2:fourier:1} 可知 $S_{2N-1}(x) =", "\\frac4\\pi\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\\frac{\\sin((2k+1)x)}{2k+1}$。取 $x_N =", "\\frac{\\pi}{2N}$，记 $u_k = (2k+1)x_N = \\frac{(2k+1)\\pi}{2N}$：", "\\[", "S_{2N-1}(x_N) = \\frac{4}{\\pi}\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\\frac{\\sin u_k}{2k+1}", "= \\frac{4}{\\pi}\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\\frac{\\sin u_k}{u_k}\\cdot", "\\frac{u_k}{2k+1}", "= \\frac{2}{\\pi}\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}\\frac{\\sin u_k}{u_k}\\cdot", "\\frac{\\pi}{N},", "\\]", "由 $\\frac{u_k}{2k+1} = \\frac{\\pi}{2N}$ 得，点 $u_k$ 恰是 $N$", "等分 $\\intcc{0}{\\pi}$ 所得子区间的中点，每段长", "$\\frac{\\pi}{N}$，该和为", "连续函数 $u \\mapsto \\frac{\\sin u}{u}$ 的中点黎曼和，因此收敛于", "\\[", "\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\int_0^\\pi \\frac{\\sin u}{u}\\,\\dd u", "\\approx \\frac{2}{\\pi}\\times 1.8519 \\approx 1.179 .", "\\]", "跳跃点附近的部分和超出值 $1$ 约 $\\approx", "18\\%$ 的半跳跃量，并且始终如此：吉布斯现象的定量刻画。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:fourier:9}", "由 $\\cos 3t = 4\\cos^3t - 3\\cos t$ 得：", "\\[", "\\cos^3 t = \\frac{3\\cos t + \\cos 3t}{4},", "\\qquad", "\\sin^2t\\,\\cos t = \\cos t - \\cos^3 t", "= \\frac{\\cos t - \\cos 3t}{4} .", "\\]", "二者都是三角多项式，因此各自等于它自己的", "傅里叶级数（系数的唯一性：两种展开式", "之差将是一个", "系数全为零的三角多项式）。对 $\\cos^3t$：$a_1 = \\frac34$，$a_3 =", "\\frac14$，其余 $a_n$ 及全部 $b_n$ 为零；$c_{\\pm1} =", "\\frac38$，$c_{\\pm3} = \\frac18$。对 $\\sin^2t\\cos t$：$a_1 =", "\\frac14$，$a_3 = -\\frac14$；$c_{\\pm1} = \\frac18$，$c_{\\pm3} =", "-\\frac18$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:fourier:10}", "直接计算：", "\\[", "c_n = \\frac{1}{2\\pi}\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}\\eu^{(a - \\iu n)t}\\dd t", "= \\frac{\\eu^{(a-\\iu n)\\pi} - \\eu^{-(a - \\iu n)\\pi}}", "{2\\pi(a - \\iu n)}", "= \\frac{(-1)^n\\sinh(a\\pi)}{\\pi(a - \\iu n)} ,", "\\]", "利用 $\\eu^{\\pm\\iu n\\pi} = (-1)^n$。在 $t = \\pi$ 处，周期延拓", "由 $\\eu^{a\\pi}$ 跳至 $\\eu^{-a\\pi}$；狄利克雷定理", "（取对称部分和）给出", "\\[", "\\cosh(a\\pi) = \\sum_{n\\in\\Z}(-1)^n c_n\\,", "= \\frac{\\sinh(a\\pi)}{\\pi}\\Bigl(\\frac1a +", "\\sum_{n\\geq1}\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{a - \\iu n} +", "\\frac{1}{a + \\iu n}\\Bigr)\\Bigr)", "= \\frac{\\sinh(a\\pi)}{\\pi}\\Bigl(\\frac1a +", "\\sum_{n\\geq1}\\frac{2a}{a^2 + n^2}\\Bigr) ,", "\\]", "成对各项的虚部相互抵消，两边除以", "$\\sinh(a\\pi)$：", "\\[", "\\coth(\\pi a) = \\frac{1}{\\pi a} +", "\\sum_{n\\geq1}\\frac{2a}{\\pi(a^2 + n^2)} ,", "\\]", "这是 \\cref{exo:b2:fourier:5} 的双曲版本。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:fourier:11}", "交换律：作代换 $s = x - t$，并利用被积函数的", "周期性。对 $c_n(f * g)$，被积函数 $(x, t) \\mapsto", "f(x-t)g(t)\\eu^{-\\iu nx}$ 连续；两个累次积分", "相等（二者均视为外层变量上限的函数，", "在左端点取零，并有相同的", "导数 --- 由连续性加上", "\\cref{thm:b2:integration:continuity} 可保证对累次积分求导", "是合理的）。因此", "\\[", "c_n(f*g) = \\frac{1}{2\\pi}\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi} g(t)\\,\\eu^{-\\iu nt}", "\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{2\\pi}\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}", "f(x-t)\\,\\eu^{-\\iu n(x-t)}\\dd x\\Bigr)\\dd t", "= c_n(f)\\,c_n(g),", "\\]", "内层积分为 $c_n(f)$，对每个 $t$ 均成立（代换与", "周期性）。最后由 \\cref{lem:b2:fourier:kernel} 可知", "$S_N(f)(x) = \\frac{1}{2\\pi}\\int f(x+u)D_N(u)\\dd u$；", "作代换 $u \\mapsto -t$，并利用 $D_N$ 的偶性，可将其化为", "$(f * D_N)(x)$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:fourier:12}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 令 $w = r\\eu^{\\iu t}$：", "        \\[", "        P_r(t) = 1 + 2\\,\\Re\\frac{w}{1 - w}", "        = \\Re\\frac{1 + w}{1 - w}", "        = \\frac{1 - \\abs w^2}{\\abs{1 - w}^2}", "        = \\frac{1 - r^2}{1 - 2r\\cos t + r^2} > 0 .", "        \\]", "        均值为 $1$：对正规收敛的", "        级数逐项积分，仅 $n = 0$ 项保留。", "  \\item 当 $\\delta \\leq \\abs t \\leq \\pi$ 时，$\\cos t \\leq", "        \\cos\\delta$，故 $P_r(t) \\leq \\frac{1 - r^2}{1 -", "        2r\\cos\\delta + r^2}$，其分母趋于 $2 -", "        2\\cos\\delta > 0$，而分子趋于 $0$：", "        一致收敛于 $0$，即在", "        $0$ 的任一邻域之外。", "  \\item 逐项积分（对 $t$ 的正规收敛）", "        得 $(f * P_r)(x) = \\sum_n r^{\\abs", "        n}c_n(f)\\eu^{\\iu nx}$。逼近单位元", "        论证：利用均值为 $1$ 及非负性，", "        \\[", "        \\abs{(f*P_r)(x) - f(x)}", "        \\leq \\frac{1}{2\\pi}\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}", "        \\abs{f(x-t) - f(x)}\\,P_r(t)\\,\\dd t ,", "        \\]", "        在 $\\abs t = \\delta$ 处分段：至多为 $\\varepsilon$", "        （由海涅定理）加上 $2\\norm f_\\infty\\sup_{\\delta\\leq\\abs", "        t\\leq\\pi}P_r \\to \\varepsilon$，故当", "        $r \\to 1^-$ 时一致收敛。这是傅里叶级数的阿贝尔求和，", "        即幂级数一章中边界理论的", "        傅里叶版本。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{solution}", ""]}